---

---

<section>
  <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-6">The live coding problem, solved</h2>
  <div
    class="flex flex-col items-center gap-6 bg-[var(--sl-color-gray-6)] border border-[var(--sl-color-gray-2)] dark:border-[var(--sl-color-gray-7)] rounded-lg p-2"
  >
    <!-- Cut from a scripted capture of the extension in VS Code; see promo/ in the repo. -->
    <video
      src="/video/promo.mp4"
      poster="/video/poster.jpg"
      autoplay
      muted
      loop
      playsinline
      preload="metadata"
      aria-label="Demo Time in VS Code: an act is written once, then each click runs the next scene: a slide, highlighted code, code typing itself in, and the presenter view."
      class="rounded-lg w-full max-w-4xl"
      style="aspect-ratio: 16 / 9"
    ></video>
    <a href="/video/tour.mp4" class="text-sm pb-2">Watch the full tour (1:30) →</a>
  </div>

  <blockquote class="mt-8 opacity-90 text-base">
    <strong>Each action was scripted and triggered with a single keypress.</strong> No typos, no missteps,
    no stress—just professional live coding demos that work every time.
  </blockquote>

  <div class="problem-solution-grid !mt-12 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 space-y-0">
    <div class="problem-section">
      <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-4 text-red-400">😰 Before Demo Time</h3>
      <ul class="space-y-2 text-base opacity-90">
        <li>Typos during live coding sessions</li>
        <li>Forgetting terminal commands under pressure</li>
        <li>Switching between PowerPoint and VS Code</li>
        <li>Losing audience attention during context switches</li>
        <li>"Let me just fix this real quick..." moments</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="solution-section">
      <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-4 text-green-400">✨ With Demo Time</h3>
      <ul class="space-y-2 text-base opacity-90">
        <li>Every step scripted and tested in advance</li>
        <li>One-key navigation through your entire demo</li>
        <li>Slides and code seamlessly integrated</li>
        <li>Complete focus on your audience</li>
        <li>Flawless execution, every single time</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
